  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "Brazil's former defense minister, a man named Aldo Rebelo who is now running for president, says that the 1996 events in Varginha, a Brazilian town where people say a craft came down and a strange creature was captured, really happened. He told Michels on the show: \"The phenomenon existed. It was there. The objects were there. The creature was seen.\" Michels, who flew to Brazil to interview him, later sums up what Rebelo said as \"Yeah, this happened,\" because it is rare for a former defense chief to say this."
}
